            "review_text": "Tourist26840288784\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nFancy Name for Awful Food.\nJun 2025 • Solo\nI had to create an account just to warn people to stay away from this awful establishment. The restaurant has a fancy name and fancy names for food, but there is NOTHING FRENCH OR ITALIAN about the dishes that they serve you. I ordered through Grab, and I couldn't believe the crap that they had the audacity to deliver. I ordered a Lasagne Verdi al Forne and the Pate de Campage as an appetizer. Look at the bs that they delivered instead--and they refuse to give me my money back. AVOID!!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nAVOID like the plague that it is!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 5, 2025",
