            "review_text": "Dag B\nKristiansand, Norway1 contribution\n0\nA saviour in Bui Vien\nJun 2024 • Solo\nThe food here is of the best food I have eaten in Ho Chi Minh City. And the owner also has an excellent and cheap guesthouse nearby. He is very knowledgeable about the workings of Ho Chi Minh City and he will help- and advice you well about everything you need to know. Both the restaurant and the guesthouse is practically in the middle of Bui Vien Street, and so all restaurants, bars and nightclubs are very nearby. I advise everybody to stay in the guesthouse and eat at the restaurant. You can even have the food from the restaurant delivered to the guesthouse. And one of the best parts, is that it is situated in the most relaxing side-streets in Bui Vien.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThey have an extensive menu, and so it is difficult to choose a favourite. But as a cook myself, I know that the food is very good.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 12, 2024",
